Capture offers only In Progress and Next tasks, inserting the full [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`route:block-id` in one accept.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]active_task_link.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/active_task_link.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-28[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-28/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Solo Pomodoro-link grammar and atomic execution[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]link-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]link-core: add the shared `@`/`^` solo grammar, the keep/move/insert [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Task Link planner with queue-respecting start, the `pomodoro_link` JSON [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]kind and human output, and CLI integration tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Active-task discovery module[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]active-task-discovery[dim] · [dim][/dim]after link-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]active-task-discovery: build a read-only scanner that lists In Progress [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and Next tasks with block IDs from routable vault-root notes, annotated [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and ordered by today's open-Pomodoro Task Links, with query ranking and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bounded warnings.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Parse, completion, rewrite, help, and docs for the new forms[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]editor-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]after active-task-discovery[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]editor-contract: expose the `pomodoro_link` mode, `^` spans, needs and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]diagnostics in capture-parse, the `active_task` full-completion context [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in capture-complete, a rewrite guard, help text, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture active-task picker and link/start preview[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-capture[dim] · [dim][/dim]after editor-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-capture: decode the new context, candidates and kind in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-mac-capture, render an active-task picker, preview and notify [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]link/move/start outcomes, and cover everything with fake-bob tests and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-28","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-28.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-f426e0bb7c1fa5cf3d05a17b128e26a9","started_at":"2026-09-27T14:40:40.935585+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-28","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-28.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-28.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-28.3","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-28.4","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-28.land"]}
